Explore Meeru Maldives and its stunning facilities, plan your visit and activities from your device before and during your visit. Use this app to start planning your stay, and ensure you don’t miss-out on any of the incredible experiences on offer at Meeru Maldives. During your stay the app provides the perfect travel companion, showing what’s on, providing you with fantastic inspiration from the recommended Must do list of experiences which you can book directly from the app.  Your itinerary is always accessible to see what adventures you have planned.  
A personal concierge in your pocket!

About the Resort:
Showing off with one of the world’s most remarkable beaches, Meeru Maldives welcomes you to experience an original beach filled holiday with a dash of simply Maldivian blending into every element of your holiday.
Meeru Maldives takes delight in serving over 40 years of excellence in the Maldives hospitality industry. Discover the original Maldivian culture all around the island including a visit to our very own state of the art island museum.  Here, together with your  loved ones,  you are bound to create Magical Moments together.

Use the app to help:
- Complete the check in registration requirements contactless;
- Explore the services and facilities available at the resort;
- Perfect your stay by booking restaurant experiences, excursions and activities such as snorkelling, scuba diving or to request to book spa treatments;
- View the entertainment schedule for the upcoming week;
- Request to book any special events that you’d like to arrange for a loved one;
- View your bills that you are incurred while at the resort;
- Book your next stay at the resort.
